<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:25:13 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a75c095cbc15</link><description>&lt;p&gt;忘了带睡衣。唯一不用提前一周或更早买票，就能在早上7:45看到《奥德赛》70mm IMAX版本的方法，就是坐在前两排。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Three people walking in a parking lot. One teenager is wearing pajama pants. " height="2268" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/duggan/6a75c095cbc15.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://duggan.some.pics"&gt;@duggan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:25:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>可爱的阿蒂巴亚</title><link>https://some.pics/6a75baa251c59</link><description>&lt;p&gt;迷人的阿蒂巴亚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Lovely Atibaia" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a75baa251c59.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 10:59:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a759f92bf599</link><description>&lt;p&gt;荷兰流行乐偶像Jerney Kaagman去世，享年79岁。她曾担任著名且成功的乐队“Earth and Fire”的主唱。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Dutch pop icon Jerney Kaagman has passed away at the age of 79. She was the leadsinger of the famous and successful band 'Earth and Fire'." height="1225" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sybrand/6a759f92bf599.jpg" width="811"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sybrand.some.pics"&gt;@sybrand&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:04:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7592e4098d3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这将会是美好的一天。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="It’s gonna be a beautiful day. " height="4012" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a7592e4098d3.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 08:10:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a75901b39bb2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天的画作是Pops，这位心地善良、糖果头的亿万富翁，是《日常工作》中公园的共同所有者。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A digital sketch of Pops from Regular Show, the cheerful, candy-headed billionaire. He has a large round pink head with a curled cream-colored mustache, a small smile, and wide, expressive eyes. He wears a black top hat, a dark gray vest over a cream long-sleeve shirt, gray pants, and black shoes. One hand is raised with a single finger pointing upward in his signature thoughtful pose. The character is centered against a warm tan textured background, with the artist's signature near his right side." height="2116" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a75901b39bb2.jpg" width="1587"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 07:58:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>